MCSKIP MT,<>
S6 holds the code of one character that is neither a letter nor a digit
and is to be treated as though it were, so that it can appear inside an
atom. Until it is set, no character has its value.
MCDEF CURRENT AS <NOW>
Before: CURRENT_POSITION and CURRENT POSITION
MCSET S6=95
After: CURRENT_POSITION and CURRENT POSITION
MCDEF CURRENT_POSITION AS <HERE>
Defined: CURRENT_POSITION and CURRENT POSITION
MCSET S6=-1
Off again: CURRENT_POSITION and CURRENT POSITION
